<title>HONG KONG: World Houseware interim net down 62 pct.</title>
<headline>World Houseware interim net down 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.2    vs 8.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    19.75  vs 51.58</p>
<p>    Turnover		     417.69 vs 381.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 World Houseware (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - World Houseware is a maker of PVC and fabric household products.</p>
<p>The company said its accounting period end date would be changed to December 31 from March 31 as announced in November, 1996, thus, the next set of financial statements will cover a nine months period to December 31 from April 1</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
